# NO LINE-ENDING CONVERSION, ANYWHERE IN THIS REPO.
#
# git's Windows default (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout.
# That changes the BYTES of every HTML build in 02-chain/, which means every
# hash in MANIFEST.txt stops matching and engine_ab starts comparing files git
# edited rather than files a builder wrote.
#
# The docs/SETUP.md instruction to pick "checkout as-is, commit as-is" is the
# belt. This is the braces: it holds even if that screen gets clicked through.
* -text

# Belt and braces on the big derivable things too. .gitignore already excludes
# them; this makes an accidental `git add -f` at least visible as binary.
*.mp4  binary
*.wav  binary
*.onnx binary
*.bin  binary
*.png  binary
*.woff2 binary
